  "solution": {
    "text": "Both the given lines are parallel to <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0081_1c7041e3ec09.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 235px; height: 152px;\" /><br />Let the angle between the line and <math><mn>6</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math> is <math><mi>θ</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>⋅</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>21</mn></mfrac></math><br />Let the&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msup></math> line is passing through <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> and the&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></msup></math> line is passing through <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br /><math><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo></math> distance between the parallel lines&nbsp;<math><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>sec</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>90</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>cosec</mi><mi>θ</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt